# Crowded pins LF for code checkouts on every OS. Several tests read
# their own source with include_str! and match on "\n" (for example the
# router/terminal-writer guards in src/app/tests.rs); a CRLF checkout on
# Windows breaks them. Added for the T1 windows-latest CI gate.
*.rs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
